# CVEs baked into the oCIS 9.0 binary (Go dependencies). Unfixable by this repo — requires an upstream owncloud/ocis release. Empty at release time; add entries only when a CVE is later disclosed in this already-released line.

# github.com/go-jose/go-jose/v3 v3.0.5 — go-jose: DoS via crafted RSA parameters
# in JWKs. 9.0.0-rc.2 bumped the /v4 module to v4.1.6, which clears that copy, but
# the binary still vendors /v3 transitively via libregraph/lico (services/idp) and
# no v3 fix exists upstream. lico parses JWKs only from local files and from
# configured OIDC authorities, so it is not attacker-reachable here. Re-check when
# lico moves to go-jose/v4.
CVE-2026-116587 exp:2027-03-31
